]},"usageMocks":{"git-github":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">💻 本地仓库</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">git push →</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">☁️ GitHub</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">远程仓库保留另一份提交记录</span>","push-rejected":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git push</b></span><span class=\"terminal-r\">! [rejected]  main -&gt; main (non-fast-forward)</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">hint: 'git pull' before pushing again.</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">远程分支已有本地缺少的提交；先获取并整合更新，再推送</span>","env-var-gitignore":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">.gitignore</span><br>node_modules<br><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">.env</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">匹配规则的未跟踪文件会被跳过；已跟踪文件要另行处理</span></div>","push-check":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">刷新 GitHub，最新提交已出现</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">✓ 已上传</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Push 后核对远端分支和最新 Commit</span></div>","push-local-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">💻 本地 ●●●●</span><span style=\"flex:1;border-top:2px dashed var(--red)\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">☁️ 空的</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">只 commit 而不 push，远程仓库不会保存这些提交</span></div>","push-force-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git push --force</b></span><span class=\"terminal-r\">+ a3f9c21...e7b2d48 main -&gt; main (forced update)</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">远程分支上已有的提交可能被重写</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">--force 会重写远程分支历史</span>","push-secret-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">.env</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">已在 GitHub 上公开可见</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">密钥一旦推送到远程仓库，即使删除提交也要按泄露处理</span></div>","npm-commit-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">node_modules 380MB</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">git push →</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">大量可重新安装的依赖进入仓库，应由 .gitignore 排除</span></div>"}}}